(IT Security Policy v2.1) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 1 ? Password Requirements) Tj T*
(All employees must use passwords of at least 12 characters.) Tj T*
(Passwords must include uppercase, lowercase, numbers and symbols.) Tj T*
(Passwords must be changed every 90 days.) Tj T*
(Sharing passwords is strictly prohibited and subject to immediate dismissal.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 2 ? Multi-Factor Authentication) Tj T*
(MFA is mandatory for all remote access to corporate systems.) Tj T*
(Approved MFA methods: hardware token, authenticator app, SMS \(last resort\).) Tj T*
(Employees who lose their MFA device must report to IT Security within 1 hour.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
