(IT Security Policy v2.1 ? Page 2) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 3 ? Acceptable Use) Tj T*
(Corporate devices must not be used for personal cryptocurrency mining.) Tj T*
(Installation of unauthorised software is prohibited.) Tj T*
(All software must be approved by the IT Security team before installation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 4 ? Incident Response) Tj T*
(Security incidents must be reported to security@company.com within 2 hours.) Tj T*
(The incident response team will acknowledge within 30 minutes.) Tj T*
(All incidents are logged in the Security Incident Register.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
