(IT Security Policy v2.1 ? Page 3) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 5 ? Data Classification) Tj T*
(Data is classified into four tiers: Public, Internal, Confidential, Restricted.) Tj T*
(Restricted data must be encrypted at rest using AES-256.) Tj T*
(Confidential data must not be sent via unencrypted email.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 6 ? Remote Work) Tj T*
(Remote employees must connect via the approved corporate VPN.) Tj T*
(Public Wi-Fi networks must not be used without VPN.) Tj T*
(Screen lock must activate after 5 minutes of inactivity.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
